From 3217fce40036b092fd27788daa07b33c5d62f3f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 01:14:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Fix action-audit defects: materials income, blank spellglass
 drops, location-aware wand refill, combat scrolls renamed tablets

- EncounterRouter.MaterialReward paid at every GoldReward site; guild-held supply caches send materials each moon
- Standard materials ratio 3:1 -> 1:1; founding stock 150 replaces the 10,000 placeholder
- Spellglass excluded from combat loot and market stock
- Wands refill at home (sortie end, new moon) except on field-party members, whose wands refill at staging anchors or the parked castle
- D6: player-facing 'scroll' combat consumables are now tablets; ids and consumeKind key unchanged

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
